{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1082", "sample_idx": 12, "model_name": "mistralai/mixtral-8x7b-instruct-v0.1", "content": " John had always been an avid gamer, spending countless hours exploring virtual worlds and completing intricate quests. But one day, as he woke up and opened his eyes, he realized something was very different. The room around him seemed to have a pixelated texture, and the sounds of birds chirping outside were oddly robotic. As he got up and walked to the mirror, he saw that his own reflection appeared to be made up of individual pixels.\n\n\nJohn's heart raced as he tried to make sense of what was happening. He looked down at his hands, turning them over and examining them closely. They too seemed to be made up of tiny, individual pixels. He quickly pulled out his phone to call for help, but the screen was blank and unresponsive. It seemed that he was truly trapped inside the video game world he had spent so many hours exploring. John knew that he had to find a way to escape before it was too late. He set off on a journey through this strange, pixelated world, determined to find a way back to reality.\n\n***\n\nAs John traveled through the game world, he encountered all sorts of challenges and obstacles. He had to fight off pixelated monsters and solve complex puzzles to make his way forward. Despite the danger, John found that he was enjoying the adventure. He felt a sense of freedom and excitement that he had never experienced before.\n\nJohn soon realized that the key to escaping the game was to find the elusive 'Game Master', a powerful character who was rumored to have the ability to alter the rules of the game. John spent days searching for the Game Master, asking other characters for information and following leads.\n\nFinally, after what felt like an eternity, John found the Game Master deep in a hidden cave. With a mixture of fear and excitement, he approached the character and asked for his help. The Game Master looked at John and smiled. \"Of course I'll help you,\" he said. \"But first, you have to prove that you're worthy. Are you ready for the ultimate challenge?\" John nodded, his heart pounding in his chest. He knew that this was his one chance to escape the game and return to the real world. He steeled himself for the challenge ahead, determined to do whatever it took to make it back home.", "logprobs": [{"token": "John", "logprob": -0.026951059699058533}, {"token": "had", "logprob": -0.05886820703744888}, {"token": "always", "logprob": -2.8490614567999728e-05}, {"token": "been", "logprob": -0.1377520114183426}, {"token": "an", "logprob": -0.023246144875884056}, {"token": "av", "logprob": -4.053033626405522e-05}, {"token": "id", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "g", "logprob": -5.61460001335945e-05}, {"token": "amer", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": "spending", "logprob": -0.10076666623353958}, {"token": "countless", "logprob": -0.0660243034362793}, {"token": "hours", "logprob": -3.576278118089249e-07}, {"token": "exploring", "logprob": -0.5636399388313293}, {"token": "virtual", "logprob": -0.005660575814545155}, {"token": "worlds", "logprob": -3.2066785934148356e-05}, {"token": "and", "logprob": -0.14506229758262634}, {"token": "completing", "logprob": -0.12799584865570068}, {"token": "intr", "logprob": -1.5978809595108032}, {"token": "icate", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "quest", "logprob": -7.557583012385294e-05}, {"token": "s", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -7.152555099310121e-07}, {"token": "But", "logprob": -0.008974689990282059}, {"token": "one", "logprob": -0.008074498735368252}, {"token": "day", "logprob": -0.0046377950347959995}, {"token": ",", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "as", "logprob": -0.3134007155895233}, {"token": "he", "logprob": -3.576278118089249e-07}, {"token": "woke", "logprob": -0.5146351456642151}, {"token": "up", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "and", "logprob": -0.00026127262390218675}, {"token"